    WebApp --> Middleware
    AdminPortal --> Middleware
    Middleware --> tRPC & Redis
    tRPC --> AuthService & ChatRouter & ChatbotRouter & FileRouter & AdminRouter & AnalyticsRouter & CrawlerRouter
