    FileRouter --> Storage & QStash & PostgreSQL
    CrawlerRouter --> QStash & PostgreSQL
    AdminRouter --> Resend & PostgreSQL
    QStash --> FileProcessor & CrawlProcessor
    FileProcessor --> RAGService & Storage & PostgreSQL
    CrawlProcessor --> Crawler & Storage & PostgreSQL
    RAGService --> EmbeddingGen
    RAGContext --> EmbeddingGen & PostgreSQL
    OpenRouter --> Models
    Models --> OpenRouter
    EmbeddingGen --> OpenAI
    OpenAI --> EmbeddingGen
    ChatbotRouter --> PostgreSQL
    AnalyticsRouter --> PostgreSQL
    AuthService --> PostgreSQL
    RAGService -.-> Logger
    CrawlProcessor -.-> Logger
    PostgreSQL -.-> Users & Chatbots & Files & Chunks & Conversations & Messages & Analytics & CrawlSources & CrawledPages
    APIRoutes --> tRPC
